vwErizzC&_nc_oc=AdktmCPyXqsNE0cysB4BkwMrdFNL_G-5AP7zYUNfi98QEpRjFnWQm0BzgrdVm0VdyvQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvYCQGABWejwWMqCUpDPbShDZwSVb1Zd2QH6yW8EuSB6w&oe=69A05054"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "497880493079740", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392030_497880496413073_6685533152652071397_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ulZeT_SwaW0Q7kNvwE1MPDl&_nc_oc=AdlKDRl-lEbVPaRJn3vWO1NcIsxYoPHgqAKaGtvmsRYhh02OKHsXxNdCJmI_TLeTqY0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft9zIlTzpbQyaVqtPbkppnhgUaugj5S-dslI5xJ1MUziQ&oe=69A059CE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "spiderarttestTitle.png", "id": "1277705199969122", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473397684_1277705203302455_7259243560357786598_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BBYm6I14XJwQ7kNvwG8LSKk&_nc_oc=AdlaoQW7izzOfjsf249y3wYwSUI4f_k1ra--LrYXQ16j5PoVdV67fcgwsJSk_1qArt8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvzqCOTCYJd6ix3SuOxKjVfqWI8u1_WZHoz5UNwboVC_w&oe=69A036D8"}, "display_name": "Spiders", "keywords": ["Spiders", "hangout", "social", "multiplayer", "climbing"], "long_description": "Spiders is a social VR experience where you inhabit a colorful arachnid and climb around finding cocoons to deliver to a nest. \n\nYou can steal cocoons from other spiders to score points, and the first spider to 10 points wins the crown! It's a deceptively simple game that's easy to pick up and hard to master. \n\nIn Spiders you can : \n\n- be a Spider!\n- choose your color\n- deck out your Arachnid in special cosmetic gear\n- make new friends (and enemies!)\n\nWith social features and addictive gameplay, Spiders is a casual, fun hangout experience that can be taken seriously as you desire, or as chill as you want. ", "short_description": "Arachnid activities for your bug buddies. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soaringrocstudi